    advanced: "The 'Match' bluff: discard a card quickly to pretend it matches your hidden card. If done correctly, you can shed high cards early. Timing the 'Dacz' call is critical: do it when you have two 0s or Lows and know opponents are still peeking.",
    tips: [
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: 'Keep your Red Kings guarded; they are the prime targets for Swaps.',
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "Don't call Dacz unless your total is below 10-15; a 20-point hand is rarely a winner.",
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "If you have a high card you can't get rid of, try to swap it with a known low card of an opponent just before calling Dacz.",
